Art and style data (upstream AgentCraft "Warm Studio" art track)
----------------------------------------------------------------
src/main/resources/assets/lab_ui/textures/gui/sprites/kit/*.png and *.png.mcmeta
    All 114 files are byte-identical to upstream AgentCraft's assets/agentcraft/textures/gui/sprites/kit/
    (added by blendi-remade on 2026-10-01, commit e67ab16); the fork only moved them.
src/main/resources/assets/lab_ui/gui/kit.json
    Upstream's file with the namespace rewritten (agentcraft -> agentcraft_worlds -> lab_ui).
src/main/resources/assets/lab_ui/gui/ui-style.json
src/main/resources/assets/lab_ui/palette.json
    Upstream's files plus the fork's additions (the ines, bram and cass cast colours, an auburn ramp,
    re-measured contrast figures).
